WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.340
One last time:

00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:05.540
say why the exact word matters when you write about history.

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.490
Keep the novel and the record apart in every sentence.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:12.430
Then open the last three ears of corn.
